# Original pattern written for the rig's tests and as a format example (SEA-4: our own).
score: 1
title: Four step rhythm
status: ready
origin: original
kind: pattern
tick: 10ms
voices: 2
technique: a four-step sequence on two voices with a sample-and-hold style CV jump every bar

@0     note  v0  A2
@0     cv    d8  0x4000
@25    trig  g8
@50    off   v0
@50    note  v1  E3
@75    trig  g8
@100   off   v1
@100   note  v0  D3
@100   cv    d8  6.40V
@125   trig  g8
@150   off   v0
@150   note  v1  G2
@175   trig  g8
@200   off   v1
@200   loop  @0
